# CODEOWNERS — OTUA Protocol
#
# This file defines who is automatically requested for review when a PR
# changes files in certain paths.
#
# Format: <pattern> <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Owners are GitHub usernames or teams (@org/team-name).
#
# IMPORTANT: This file contains placeholder entries.
# Replace @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER with the actual GitHub username(s) of the
# repository maintainers before merging security-sensitive code.
# See DEVELOPERS.md for instructions on updating CODEOWNERS.
#
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything not matched by a more specific rule.
*                                   @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER

# Contract code — requires security-aware review.
contracts/                          @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER

# Protocol specification — requires protocol design review.
PROTOCOL_SPEC.md                    @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
docs/protocol/                      @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
docs/decisions/                     @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER

# Security policy and threat model.
SECURITY.md                         @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
docs/security/                      @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER

# CI and GitHub configuration.
.github/                            @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER

# Shared package APIs.
packages/                           @OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
